ct_interr_invalid_name_body:
Do to restrictions put in place by discord, after trimming leading/trailing whitespace on an interactions name it must be less than 32 characters, and more than 1 character. If the interaction is a slash command, it must have less than 3 spaces, be all lowercase, and not contain any characters other than letters and -s. You can use the regex `^(?:[\w-]{1,32} {0,1}){1,3}$` to test your slash command name.

